{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a child left alone in the house at night.<br>The lights keep you safe. The darkness does not.<br>Finish your chores\u2026 before something finishes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brief, <strong>replayable horror experience</strong> about fear, light, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete simple tasks</strong>: pick up toys, tidy the room, while avoiding what lurks in the dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979840/extras/413e30cb390addc2456baa834f2fa159.poster.avif?t=1756758669\" aria-label=\"Tasks\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979840/extras/413e30cb390addc2456baa834f2fa159.webm?t=1756758669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979840/extras/413e30cb390addc2456baa834f2fa159.mp4?t=1756758669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the generator and keep the lights alive</strong> before the battery drains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <strong>anomalies</strong> and events that twist each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: from unsettling truths to one fragile hope</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979840?t=1756758669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979840?t=1756758669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979840/89bead6b9980ba68c7f7ff4832c489f1d96cf2